        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add compatibility data for the <code class=\"notranslate\">viewTypes</code> property in <code class=\"notranslate\">webextensions.api.menus.create</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">webextensions.api.menus.update</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Firefox 64 added support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">viewTypes</code> property in both <code class=\"notranslate\">menus.create()</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">menus.update()</code> (see <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1416839\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1416839</a> and <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Firefox/Releases/64\" rel=\"nofollow\">Firefox 64 release notes</a>).</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related to <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5544845808\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615\">#30615</a></p>",
