            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Remove <code class=\"notranslate\">version_removed: \"17\"</code> for <code class=\"notranslate\">api.CSSStyleDeclaration.cssFloat</code> in Firefox.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">CSSStyleDeclaration.cssFloat</code> (<code class=\"notranslate\">document.body.style.cssFloat</code>) has been supported in Gecko/Firefox since Firefox 1 and was never removed. Collector data confirms support continues in Firefox 17 and later versions.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #20813.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"1913184494\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20813\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20813/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/20813\">#20813</a></p>",
