        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Add compatibility subfeatures for <code class=\"notranslate\">menus.update()</code> properties: <code class=\"notranslate\">icons</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">visible</code>.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">icons</code>: Supported in Firefox 64 (via <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1414566\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1414566</a>) and Safari 18 (via WebKit bug 275529). Chrome does not support icons in context menus.</li>\n<li><code class=\"notranslate\">visible</code>: Supported in Chrome 62, Firefox 63 (via <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1482529\" rel=\"nofollow\">Bug 1482529</a>), and Safari 14.</li>\n<li>Matches existing property coverage under <code class=\"notranslate\">menus.create</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30615.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5544845808\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30615\">#30615</a></p>",
