        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\">Document that before Firefox 149, <code class=\"notranslate\">URLPattern</code> did not support lookahead and lookbehind regex syntax.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>In Firefox versions prior to 149, <code class=\"notranslate\">URLPattern</code> used the Rust regex engine which did not support lookahead and lookbehind assertions, causing patterns containing them to throw. In Firefox 149 (via bug 1984171), the implementation was updated to use SpiderMonkey regex for full web compatibility.</li>\n<li>Bugzilla bug 1998871: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1998871\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1998871</a></li>\n<li>Bugzilla bug 1984171: <a href=\"https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984171\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1984171</a></li>\n<li>Per recommendation from maintainer in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3969152922\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29092\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29092/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29092\">#29092</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #29092.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3969152922\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29092\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29092/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/29092\">#29092</a></p>",
