        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update <code class=\"notranslate\">webextensions.api.runtime.onMessage.return_promise</code> compatibility data to reflect that returning a <code class=\"notranslate\">Promise</code> from <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.onMessage</code> listeners is supported starting in Chrome 148.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Official Chrome extensions documentation confirms that <code class=\"notranslate\">runtime.onMessage</code> listeners can return a <code class=\"notranslate\">Promise</code> directly to send an asynchronous response starting in Chrome 148: <a href=\"https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/develop/concepts/browser-namespace\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.chrome.com/docs/extensions/develop/concepts/browser-namespace</a></li>\n<li>Local validation (<code class=\"notranslate\">npm run fix</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">npm test</code>) passed with 100% test coverage and 0 errors.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30194.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5090186547\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30194\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30194/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30194\">#30194</a></p>",
