        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the missing <code class=\"notranslate\">nfc</code> permission descriptor to <code class=\"notranslate\">api/Permissions.json</code>.</li>\n<li>Reuses browser support and status metadata from the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">api/NDEFReader.json</code> entry (supported on Chrome for Android from version 89).</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Defined in the W3C Web NFC specification under <a href=\"https://w3c-cg.github.io/web-nfc/#obtaining-permission\" rel=\"nofollow\">Obtaining permission</a> (\"The Web NFC API is a default powerful feature which is identified by the powerful feature/name <code class=\"notranslate\">nfc</code>\").</li>\n<li>Present in Chromium IDL: <code class=\"notranslate\">third_party/blink/renderer/modules/permissions/permission_descriptor.idl</code>.</li>\n<li>Matches existing Web NFC metadata and passes consistency checks (<code class=\"notranslate\">webview_android: false</code> matching <code class=\"notranslate\">api.Permissions</code>).</li>\n<li>All local linters and unit tests (<code class=\"notranslate\">npm run fix</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">npm test</code>) passed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the <code class=\"notranslate\">nfc</code> checklist item in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2616274291\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831\">#24831</a>.</p>",
