        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Update <code class=\"notranslate\">http.headers.Clear-Site-Data.cookies</code> for Safari to mark it as <code class=\"notranslate\">partial_implementation: true</code> with a note that only cookies matching the response host are cleared.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Safari removes only cookies whose domain exactly matches the response host; cookies set with a <code class=\"notranslate\">Domain</code> attribute are kept, which diverges from the Clear-Site-Data specification requiring registrable domain cookie clearing.</li>\n<li>Documented and tracked in WebKit bug 325085 (<a href=\"https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325085\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://bugs.webkit.org/show_bug.cgi?id=325085</a>).</li>\n<li>Root cause identified in WebKit source (<code class=\"notranslate\">NetworkStorageSession::deleteCookies</code> in <code class=\"notranslate\">Source/WebKit/NetworkProcess/cocoa/NetworkStorageSessionCocoa.mm</code>), where host-exact matching (<code class=\"notranslate\">domain == String(cookie.domain)</code>) is used.</li>\n<li>Tested and reproduced on macOS Safari and iOS/iPadOS Safari.</li>\n<li>All local linter and unit tests (<code class=\"notranslate\">npm run fix</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">npm test</code>) passed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"issue-keyword tooltipped tooltipped-se\" aria-label=\"This pull request closes issue #30649.\">Fixes</span> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5561726736\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30649\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30649/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/30649\">#30649</a></p>",
