            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75256866?u=e8b7f1039e5b3d31d8f1d9a206b6046d6c684fc8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add the missing <code class=\"notranslate\">background-fetch</code> permission descriptor to <code class=\"notranslate\">api/Permissions.json</code>.</li>\n<li>Mirror browser support and status metadata from the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">api/BackgroundFetchManager.json</code> entry.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">All schema, linting, and unit tests (<code class=\"notranslate\">npm test</code>) were executed locally and passed with zero errors.<br>\nThe support data matches the existing <code class=\"notranslate\">BackgroundFetchManager</code> entry (added in Chrome 74). The WICG Background Fetch specification integrates with the Permissions API via the <code class=\"notranslate\">\"background-fetch\"</code> PermissionDescriptor name, and Blink's <code class=\"notranslate\">permission_descriptor.idl</code> defines this descriptor.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Sources:</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Specification: <a href=\"https://wicg.github.io/background-fetch/#background-fetch-manager\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://wicg.github.io/background-fetch/#background-fetch-manager</a></li>\n<li>Chromium IDL: <a href=\"https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/permissions/permission_descriptor.idl\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/+/refs/heads/main/third_party/blink/renderer/modules/permissions/permission_descriptor.idl</a></li>\n<li>MDN BCD reference: <code class=\"notranslate\">api/BackgroundFetchManager.json</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Addresses the <code class=\"notranslate\">background-fetch</code> checklist item in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"2616274291\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/issues/24831\">#24831</a>.</p>",
