        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1152698?u=5ce323090a48b425ec70128365c96809699959f7&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Add <code class=\"notranslate\">api/OpaqueRange.json</code> with the OpaqueRange interface, its <code class=\"notranslate\">collapsed</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">startOffset</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">endOffset</code> properties, and <code class=\"notranslate\">disconnect</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">getBoundingClientRect</code>/<code class=\"notranslate\">getClientRects</code> methods.</li>\n<li>Add <code class=\"notranslate\">createValueRange()</code> method to HTMLInputElement and HTMLTextAreaElement.</li>\n<li>Add a spec-urls lint exception for the MSEdgeExplainers OpaqueRange explainer, since formal specs are still in PR stage. PRs:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>DOM PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3410621075\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/1404\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/dom/pull/1404/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/dom/pull/1404\">whatwg/dom#1404</a></li>\n<li>HTML PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3478824122\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/11741\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/whatwg/html/pull/11741/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11741\">whatwg/html#11741</a></li>\n<li>CSSOM-View PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3489303548\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/12904\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/12904/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/12904\">w3c/csswg-drafts#12904</a></li>\n<li>CSS Custom Highlight API PR: <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"4456278761\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13929\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/13929/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/pull/13929\">w3c/csswg-drafts#13929</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/MicrosoftEdge/Demos/tree/main/opaque-range\">Demo source</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://microsoftedge.github.io/Demos/opaque-range/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Live demo</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-edge/web-platform/release-notes/152#opaquerange-for-form-control-text\" rel=\"nofollow\">Edge release notes</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/6297362687066112\" rel=\"nofollow\">ChromeStatus entry</a></li>\n</ul>",
